[{"id":164810763,"discussion_id":"a667512b3d140ab2f104dc6a9ae9ff719c5a540d","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| norm | ✅ [*liujie12345678*](https://gitcode.com/liujie12345678), [*zhajianqing123*](https://gitcode.com/zhajianqing123) (2/2) | ✅ [*liujie12345678*](https://gitcode.com/liujie12345678) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:18:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T15:21:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164810774,"discussion_id":"164700d83559ab5ed3a86fa0e2371a5d39330c88","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:19:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T16:19:01+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164810786,"discussion_id":"1058b3c573105e77f5f29c490798744d29d6a8a2","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n Chen_HaoWen, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:19:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T16:19:02+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164811155,"discussion_id":"f1e07ed983687b397b9eb6a6504c1c8b88bbb8b1","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本PR旨在优化AddLayerNormGrad算子内核的性能与鲁棒性。原实现中的数据拷贝逻辑在特定硬件架构（如AI Core 220/310）和参数配置（如大stride或padding场景）下存在性能瓶颈，并可能引发数据拷贝错误。本次修改通过重构数据加载策略，解决了这些潜在问题，增强了算子对不同场景的适应能力。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心方案是重构`copyIn`函数，将其拆分为三条独立的优化路径以应对不同场景：1) 对于支持AIV指令集的特定AI Core，使用带填充功能的向量化拷贝(`copyInWithPad`)；2) 对于通用场景（stride在uint16范围内），使用原有的向量化参数拷贝(`copyInWithParams`)；3) 对于stride过大的场景，降级为逐行拷贝(`copyInByRow`)以确保正确性。同时，移除了冗余标志变量，并引入`UINT16_MAX_VALUE`常量进行stride边界检查，使代码更清晰、健壮。","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:20:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T16:20:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164812881,"discussion_id":"b35ba75f2b4c65b3abc071a88490ee0ba67a0279","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:28:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T16:28:03+08:00","user":{"id":"68b14ec355aaf21f7ae618e0","login":"Chen_HaoWen","object_id":"68b14ec35